{title: 510 - If You But Trust in God to Guide You}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #510 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 510}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Gm]If you [Dm]but [Gm]trust [F]in [Eb]God [F7/C]to [Dm]guide you
[Bb]And place [Cm]your [Dm]confidence in [Gm]Him,
[Gm]You'll find [Dm]Him [Gm]always [Eb]there [F7/C]beside [Dm]you,
[Bb]To give [Cm]you [Dm]hope [Gm/Bb]and [Cm]strength [Dm]within.
[Dm]For those [Gm]who [F]trust [Bb]God's [Gm]changeless [Bb]love
[Gm]Build [Dm]on [Eb]the [Dm]rock [Gm/Bb]that [Cm]will [Dm]not [Gm]move.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Gm]What gain is [Dm]there [Gm]in [F]futile [Dm]weeping,
[Bb]In helpless [Dm]anger [Cm]and [Dm]distress?
[Gm]If you [Dm]are [Gm]in [F]His [Eb]care [F7/C]and [Dm]keeping,
[Bb]In sorrow [Dm]will [Gm/Bb]He [Cm]love [Dm]you [Gm]less?
[Dm]For [Gm]He [F]who [Bb]took [Gm]for [Eb]you [F]a [Bb]cross
[Gm]Will bring [Dm]you [Eb]safe [Dm]through [Gm/Bb]every loss.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Gm]In patient trust [F]await [F7/C]His [Dm]leisure
[Bb]In cheerful [Dm]hope, [Gm/Bb]with [Cm]heart [Dm]content
[Gm]To take [Dm]whate'er [F]your [Eb]Father's [Dm]pleasure
[Bb]And all [Cm]discerning love [Dm]have [Gm]sent;
[Dm]Doubt [Gm]not [F]your [Bb]inmost [Eb]wants [F]are [Bb]known
[Gm]To [Dm]Him [Eb]who [Dm]chose [Gm/Bb]you [Cm]for [Dm]His [Gm]own.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Gm]Sing, pray, [Dm]and [Gm]keep [F]His [Eb]ways [F7/C]unswerving,
[Bb]Offer [Cm]your [Dm]service [Cm]faithfully,
[Gm]And trust [Dm]His [Gm]word; [F]though [Eb]undeserving,
[Bb]You'll find [Cm]His [Dm]promise [Cm]true [Dm]to [Gm]be.
[Dm]God [Gm]never [Bb]will [Gm]forsake [F]in [Bb]need
[Gm]The [Dm]soul [Eb]that [Dm]trusts [Gm/Bb]in [Cm]Him [Dm]indeed.
{end_of_verse}
